doubts  about  Puranic  cosmology,  it  seems  likely  that  for  them,  at  least,  the 
mapping  was  simply  an  artificial  attempt  to  force  this  cosmology  into  a  three- 
dimensional  framework  and  thereby  make  sense  out  of  it.  We  therefore  suggest 
that  although  historical  Indian  astronomers  such  as  Bhaskaracarya  were  carry¬ 
