dimensional  nature  of  structures  such  as  Bhu-mandala,  and  they  consequently 
focused  their  attention  on  those  features  of  Vedic  astronomy  that  can  be  readily 
understood  in  three-dimensional  terms. 

In  recent  centuries,  many  Vaisnavas  have  also  experienced  perplexity  in 
their  efforts  to  understand  the  relationship  between  Bhu-mandala  and  the  earth 
globe  of  our  direct  experience.  This  is  shown  in  Appendix  1,  where  we 
