not  surprising  that  many  statements  in  it  are  bewildering  from  our  gross  sensory 
perspective.  It  is  therefore  reasonable  to  follow  the  example  of  the  acaryas  and 
simply  receive  these  statements  with  faith.  If  this  is  done,  then  further  insight 
may  come  in  due  course  of  time.  (In  contrast,  the  approach  of  skeptical  rejection 
is  not  likely  to  lead  to  further  study  and  insight.) 

