converted  from  minutes  to  degrees.  According  to  Toomer,  “The  conclusion 
seems  inevitable  that  he  [Ptolemy]  is  here  using,  directly  or  indirectly,  the  old 
chord  table  of  Hipparchus”  (TM1,  p.  25). 

Yet  there  are  many  ways  in  which  Ptolemy  might  have  arrived  at  these 
